# 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Implementation Plan: Family Member Management System

Implement a comprehensive, production-grade **Family Member Appointment & Medical Record System** matching Practo / Apollo 24/7. Supports zero-friction dependent management (for kids & elderly without phones) and dual-channel (Email + WhatsApp) OTP verification for linking adult family accounts.

---

## 🎯 Architectural Overview & Dual-Flow Design

```
                               ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
                               │           ADD FAMILY MEMBER FLOW             │
                               └──────────────────────┬───────────────────────┘
                                                      │
                       ┌──────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────┐
                       ▼                                                             ▼
        ┌─────────────────────────────┐                               ┌─────────────────────────────┐
        │  OPTION A: ADD DEPENDENT    │                               │ OPTION B: LINK ADULT MEMBER │
        │  (Children, Elderly Parents)│                               │ (Spouse, Adult Siblings)    │
        └──────────────┬──────────────┘                               └──────────────┬──────────────┘
                       │                                                             │
         • NO Phone/Email needed                                        • Enters Email ID or Phone Number
         • Instant Save with Legal Guardian                            • System sends 6-digit OTP via
           Consent Declaration                                            FREE Email + FREE WhatsApp API
         • Managed 100% under Primary Owner                            • Verification completes link request
```

